WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.860
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.990
I'm Nijino Yume.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.990
A second-year at the idol 
middle school, Four Star Academy.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:22.660
As a top idol in S4, I work hard at my Aikatsu every day.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:29.500
An idol school upon an extravagant cruise liner sailing around the world collecting skilled idols,

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.180
Venus Ark, suddenly appeared before us.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:39.970
And to make matters worse, the owner and top idol Elza Forte has scouted me.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:45.810
Come to Venus Ark. I'll give you what you desire.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:50.230
Yume already told you she wasn't going!

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:56.360
Plus, Hime-senpai is taking a leave of absence to go on a journey.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.870
I understood after seeing Elza-chan.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:02.120
That there was something I was missing.{if you changed it back last episode, don't again}{the sooner they never say this again, the better}

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.120
I'm going to go find it.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:09.420
I may be in S4 now, but there's still so much I'm worried about.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.210
But this isn't the time to be sitting still!

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.810
<i>Elza Forte...</i>

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:28.690
<i>Also known as Perfect Elza.</i>

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:34.490
<i>As she says, she who controls the dresses controls Aikatsu.</i>

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:45.750
<i>It is true, only the chosen ones are permitted to don a Star Premium Rare Coord.</i>

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.380
<i>Her winged coord...</i>

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:53.000
<i>They are the symbols of perfection. {from ep 51 but altered}</i>

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.890
<i>Star wings radiating brilliantly...</i>

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:05.180
<i>I, too, wish to bear them.</i>

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.360
<i>The time has come...</i>

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:20.820
<i>for me to release the seal on my Premium Rare Dress.</i>

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.500
<i>Yes, it has come...</i>

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:04.010
Talk of Elza-san is buzzing in every room and hallway.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.890
Her performance and Star Premium Rare Coord were mind-blowing.{not that I'd ever object to capitalizing a thing, but don't we usually not capitalize Coord?}{it was updated}

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.480
Yeah, I'd have to agree.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:14.520
Onee-chan said her fashion sense was outstanding too.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:18.650
Wow, she even got Yozora-senpai's seal of approval!

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:22.030
Her brand, Perfect Queen,

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:28.410
which crisply encapsulates the concepts of luxury and gorgeousness, is really popular.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:33.920
Yeah, her dress fully embodied her brand's image.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:37.040
I've gotta work hard too!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:42.050
No, it's wrong! This isn't what I'm going for!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.010
Hey, what's wrong?{is it okay for laura to be hanging so casually in the S4 garden thing?}{et tu?}

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:52.060
Right now, she's trying to strengthen the image of her own brand, Berry Parfait.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.730
Hey, Yume.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.530
Rola.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.570
What are you drawing?

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.200
A strawberry shortcake.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.410
And what is that next to it?

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.580
A chocolate parfait!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:14.710
So the strawberry represents the berry part, and the parfait represents the parfait part? {screw you laura, there's no distinction in either japanese or english}

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:18.170
You nailed it, Rola! I knew you'd understand.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.000
I think you missed the point.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.840
Put the whole desserts thing aside for now.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:32.720
I can't get her Star Premium Rare Coord out of my mind!

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.930
I know what you mean.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.230
That's Perfect Elza for you.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:40.860
Those star wings...

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.730
Weren't they incredible?

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.360
They were unlike anything I've ever seen.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:52.160
Seeing her on stage made me realize again just how important having a good sense for dresses is.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.410
I want them!

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.620
Both the coord and her sense!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.500
Heya!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.540
We should be heading to the TV station soon.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:02.500
Yeah!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.670
Okay!

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:05.880
Go give 'em your best smiles today!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.800
Sure, see you later!

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:18.100
I have no interest in those without even a brand to their name.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.610
<i>I got told.</i>

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:24.030
<i>It's true that I haven't given it much thought before.</i>

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.530
<i>Having a brand, being a muse...</i>

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.030
<i>And getting a Premium Rare Dress.</i>

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.830
<i>But to get one for myself,</i>

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.620
<i>I need them all.</i>

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.830
<i>That's it! I should get my own brand.</i>

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.840
<i>That'll be my new goal.</i>

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:46.840
We look forward to working with you.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.470
Hey, jumbo ribbon!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.220
I heard you made it into S4.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:53.550
You're making me blush.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.720
And that's why...

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:58.850
You can't go calling her jumbo ribbon anymore!

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:00.730
Then what should I say?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.730
All right! How does S jumbo ribbon sound?

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:06.730
That's pretty much the same thing!

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.240
Who are you?!

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:17.580
Let me introduce you. This is our station's image character, Fufufu-kun.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.870
Fufufu!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.870
Image character?

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:26.130
He'll be appearing on all sorts of shows in order to increase our station's appeal.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.680
And speaking of which...

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.890
Okay, give me a smile!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.480
So cute!

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.890
I just can't hate that shape.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.900
He definitely gets full marks for appeal.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:46.610
He just makes me want to throw him over my shoulder!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.070
Yume-senpai, you most definitely should not.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.910
<i>A strong appeal...</i>

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:59.750
Excuse me, Owner? Could I take a bit of your time?

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.210
Yes, of course.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:12.930
I-I was hoping to increase the impact of Berry Parfait's brand image.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.550
These are a few of my ideas...

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:19.430
S-So, what do you think?

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.140
I understand.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.190
Which do you like?

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.650
You've strayed too far off the path.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:34.610
Listen, Yume. If you were to ask me what makes a 
dress appealing, I'd be able to answer immediately.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:38.330
It must first and foremost delight oneself.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.950
Delight oneself...

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.210
Let's see...

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.900
Lily-senpai!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.150
Fancy seeing you here.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.840
Which is why I wanted to gather things that I liked.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:34.090
I see. Those feelings you harbor towards your dress

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:40.350
will eventually awaken the sleeping lion inside you.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.100
Sleeping lion?

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:45.980
A designer I greatly respect once said:

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.100
"Endowments are what we are born with.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:52.110
Talent is what one makes of them." {another quote that only exists in Japanese, although Coco Chanel does have a huge list of real ones}

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:57.950
Um, does that mean I have talents still sleeping inside me?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:58.610
Yes.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:02.490
Getting a compliment from you makes me so happy!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.410
Wake up, my talents!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.870
What were you here for, Lily-senpai?

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:09.630
Right...

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:15.510
Let us say that there are as many types of beauty as there are women.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:19.340
Dresses are what makes our beauty infinite.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:23.510
They adorn us with their countless forms.

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:25.470
O-Okay?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.400
Dresses are constantly influenced by trends.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:36.780
Even the most dazzling light fades in nary a moment.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:44.540
I have wished to create a dress under my brand with everlasting sheen.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:46.830
G-Go on...

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:50.460
And then I saw just such a thing before my eyes.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.710
Elza Forte's Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:11:00.180
Her star wings will shine eternally.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.300
After witnessing it...

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.680
I decided to release the seal.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.520
Huh? The seal?

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:12.690
Yes. I believe I have told you of it before.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:19.360
At the time, I sealed away the creation of my Premium Rare Dress until after I entered S4.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:29.330
My dream of making S4 dissolved as if the bubbles of a heartbroken Little Mermaid.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:34.130
But now I have a new dream—nay, a goal.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.880
I will grasp a Star Premium Rare Coord with my own two hands.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:42.340
And thus I have released the seal!

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.230
Open Sesame!

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.110
How lovely!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:06.910
Lily-senpai, please allow me to assist you!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:12.120
However, do you not have your own endeavors to attend to?

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.670
I do!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.880
That's why I think this'll be a good lesson for me!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.420
Right you are.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:22.880
Lilienne spotted!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.390
I've been looking for you, Lilienne.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.640
Yuzu-senpai.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:27.550
Yuzu.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.350
It's time for your training.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:30.390
Training?

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:36.560
Yep! Lilienne's been doing special training every day to make her Premium Rare Dress!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.520
To create a magnificent dress,

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:44.200
I have decided to better myself in order to cultivate the sound mind it requires.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.910
Lilienne's working her butt off!

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:49.330
Special training for dress making?

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.120
One!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:56.130
Lilienne, fight! Fight!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:01.050
That's the way! Now, two!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.430
Fight, Lilienne!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.430
T-T—

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:13.810
Two!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.810
Yay! You're amazing, Lilienne!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.610
Yuzu!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:25.200
You're amazing, Lilienne! That's a new record!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:28.030
Yes! I could not have done it without you, Yuzu!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.280
Excuse me.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.950
I have a question.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.460
Go ahead, Nijino-kun.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:38.460
This training is for making a Premium Rare Dress, right?

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.710
You bet!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:44.010
A sound mind dwells in a sound body. {maybe healthy should've}{definitely not}

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:47.090
Thus I have decided to prioritize endurance building.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.180
I-I see!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:52.220
Then what about your new push-up record?

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.350
Two times!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:56.480
She couldn't even do one a week ago!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.190
W-Wow...

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.480
That's great progress!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:03.480
And with that, let's wrap up for today!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.490
What?! Already?!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.910
I worked up a nice sweat!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:20.130
I see. This runs deep.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.130
You have so many different materials.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:34.060
Yes, each variety of lace confers a unique feeling upon the dress.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.310
But they're both blue... {I think they're slightly different}{everything is different, it's only a question of how different they are}{that might go in my book}

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:39.650
Lilienne's really particular about it!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.070
Would you mind looking at this?

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.610
You made one already!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.940
It's wonderful!

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:47.900
No.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.370
It is not yet complete.

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:56.410
Blue roses are my signature motif.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.250
I've used them extensively to date.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:02.750
Therefore, I want to use a different accent this time.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:06.630
<i>It's already so great, but she's not satisfied enough to call it complete?</i>

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:11.970
Regardless of how many references I peruse or materials I gather,

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:16.770
they are not coming together in the way I envision.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.480
Eureka!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.980
At times like this...

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:32.660
Yep, times like this call for sugary drinks.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.160
Thank you for treating me.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.160
Don't worry about it.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:41.250
Yuzu, I am grateful, but my mood is not...

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:55.680
Here.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.470
Thank you.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.520
Yuzu!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:03.520
A dramatist once said, "Throw away your books, rally in the streets." {sort of, it's a film title}{I'm sure he said at one point}

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:05.560
It's just as he said!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.980
Thank you! I must hurry and design—

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:08.690
Drink.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.570
Don't rush, don't rush.{awatenaide— my heart}

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:14.280
It won't be too late after having your shake.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.700
That's true.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:35.220
I see. And that led to Lily-senpai 
completing her Premium Rare dress.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:38.850
What's more impressive is being able to debut it this quickly.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.720
Well, about that...

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:44.730
I've completed it at last.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:49.780
All that is left is to find the ideal way to debut it.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:53.280
Actually, about that...

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.370
Hello?

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.080
Huh? Is this Piroshenko-san?

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:03.620
Yes... thank you so much.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:12.260
He has made arrangements for me to debut my new Gothic Victoria dress!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:16.130
Wow, that's great for you, Lilienne!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:17.890
Yuzu...

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.970
Yuzu-senpai, nice!

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.390
She's great.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.310
Yeah!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.400
It's starting.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:39.910
<i>Bearing a motif of sweet white and blue roses,</i>

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:43.410
<i>it is a gothic coord which maintains its solemnity.</i>

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:49.420
<i>Thorns and roses decorate the wire pannier birdcage accent.</i>

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:55.550
Shirogane Lily, pouring my soul into this moment!

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.490
Star wings!

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:07.530
Wow...

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:11.660
Lily-senpai's been accepted by the Aikatsu System!{oder accepted}

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.080
The Tundra Diva got wings!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.670
Lily-chan was magnificent!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:22.670
So the one to obtain the Pluto wings {rip}{good thing we didn't use planet huh}

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:26.680
is you, Lily Shirogane.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:31.680
I now hold a Star Premium Rare Coord! This feels like a dream!

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:33.930
You did it, Lilienne!

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:35.560
Yuzu...

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:36.980
I could not have without you.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.940
You don't need to tell me that.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:41.860
Either way, I had fun helping you make your dress.

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.280
Lily-senpai!

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:46.530
Your performance, your dress, and not to mention...

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:48.820
Your star wings were all wonderful!

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:52.660
After seeing your wings unfurl, I can imagine you flying away at any moment!

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:56.290
You made me want to get my own Star Premium Rare Coord too!

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:58.710
Thank you.

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:04.300
There's something I learned from helping you make your dress.

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.180
You've got to enjoy worrying about every little part of the process.

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:14.520
That's what makes fashion so interesting!

00:22:16.940 --> 00:22:20.440
Yes... yes, you're right.

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:22.440
Yeah!

00:23:56.240 --> 00:24:00.580
Lily-senpai's Rosetta Thorn Coord really moved me! {literally what the fuck, I don't even see any visual clues}{what}

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:04.750
Yeah, my heart skipped a beat when her wings appeared.

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:09.300
I get you! I want to take off with my own wings too one day!

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:12.300
Return my brand!

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:12.970
Baa!

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:13.720
Hiss!

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:14.470
Baa!

00:24:14.470 --> 00:24:15.260
Hiss! {I think this is Kirara too, combine with previous?}{maybe?}{okay, Ako has a more throaty voice, so I'm more confident it's Kirara. leaving as is}

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:17.220
Baa—wait, huh?

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:19.350
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:21.680
Kirara, The Fluffy Idol.

00:24:21.680 --> 00:24:24.020
Become the first-star idol!
